  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a small bowl, mix together yeast, almond flour, coconut flour, curry powder, garam masala, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add ghee to the dry mixture and mix until crumbly.",
